  claim_note "Issue 1175 R3: claim rows are consulted after formalization and before a handler runs. A handler with a row is offered the prompt only when one of its admits_on evidence kinds holds in the prompt's structure, so no surface word alone can claim it; a handler with no row is admitted as before."
  claim_note "Issue 1175 R3 refusal lane: a row that names a refusal_event admits its handler without the evidence to refuse only. The handler runs, and its answer is kept only when the handler recorded that refusal event, so a cued request without its operand keeps its honest named refusal while no answer can be claimed on the cue alone."
  claim
    handler software_project
    browser_handler trySoftwareProjectRequest
    admits_on object_phrase_artifact
    admits_on approval_of_a_proposal
    because "issue 1175 R2: the artifact kind is the head noun of the authoring verb's object phrase, never an artifact word elsewhere in the prompt; a bare go-ahead moves an earlier plan forward"
  claim
    handler terminal_command
    browser_handler tryTerminalCommand
    admits_on shell_command_shape
    admits_on semantic_shell_task
    because "issue 1175 R1: a leading shell token claims only when the rest parses as command arguments, so a sentence that opens with an English word that is also a command is prose"
  claim
    handler repository_lineage
    admits_on repository_subject
    because "issue 1180 R10: a history cue claims only with an existing path, a status phrase or a census symbol to answer about"
  claim
    handler page_query_text
    browser_handler tryPageQueryText
    admits_on supplied_page
    because "issue 1175 R3: a page query claims only a prompt whose first line is the query and whose remaining lines are the page it supplies; a question that merely mentions a page is not one"
  claim
    handler javascript_execution
    browser_handler tryJavaScriptExecution
    admits_on javascript_program
    because "issue 1175 R3: running a program claims only when a program can be extracted from the prompt, never on a run word alone"
  claim
    handler incompatible_units
    browser_handler tryIncompatibleUnits
    admits_on incompatible_unit_pair
    because "issue 1175 R3: an incompatibility claims only when two measurement units of different physical dimensions are both named"
  claim
    handler http_fetch
    admits_on fetch_url
    because "issue 1175 R3: a fetch claims only with a URL operand the request asks to retrieve, never on a fetch word alone"
  claim
    handler url_navigate
    admits_on navigation_url
    because "issue 1175 R3: a navigation claims only with a URL operand the request asks to open"
  claim
    handler calendar_create_event
    admits_on calendar_date_signal
    because "issue 1175 R3: an event claims only with a date signal backed by an entity such as a clock hour, a timezone or a participant, or an explicit scheduling act"
  claim
    handler code_debugging
    browser_handler tryCodeDebugging
    admits_on code_artifact
    because "issue 1175 R3: a debugging request claims only with the code it debugs, a fenced block, a code-shaped backtick span, a definition or the payload after a command colon"
  claim
    handler code_explanation
    browser_handler tryCodeExplanation
    admits_on code_artifact
    because "issue 1175 R3: an explanation of code claims only with the code it explains, never on an explain word alone"
  claim
    handler code_review
    browser_handler tryCodeReview
    admits_on code_artifact
    because "issue 1175 R3: a review claims only with the code it reviews, never on a review word alone"
  claim
    handler summarization_text
    browser_handler trySummarizationText
    admits_on supplied_text
    because "issue 1175 R3: a free-text summary claims only with the text the request carries after a command colon, a line break or quotes"
  claim
    handler text_rewrite
    browser_handler tryTextRewrite
    admits_on supplied_text
    because "issue 1175 R3: a rewrite, a correction or a genre rendering claims only with the text the request carries, never on a rewrite word alone"
  claim
    handler statistics
    browser_handler tryStatistics
    admits_on stated_number
    because "issue 1175 R3: a statistics or one-number primality question claims only with the numbers it states, never on a measure or property word alone"
  claim
    handler word_problem
    browser_handler tryWordProblem
    admits_on stated_number
    because "issue 1175 R3: a word problem claims only with the quantities it states, never on a price, gain or share word alone"
  claim
    handler arithmetic
    browser_handler tryArithmetic
    admits_on calculation_expression
    admits_on currency_rate_basis
    because "issue 1175 R3: a calculation claims only with the expression the calculator reader extracts, or the named currency pair whose rate basis it asks"
  claim
    handler compound_interest
    browser_handler tryCompoundInterest
    admits_on investment_terms
    admits_on conversion_target_currency
    because "issue 1175 R3: an interest problem claims only with its principal, rate, compounding and term, and its follow-up only with the currency the earlier final amount converts to"
  claim
    handler number_constraint_reasoning
    browser_handler tryNumberConstraintReasoning
    admits_on interval_bounds
    because "issue 1175 R3: a hidden-number riddle claims only with the lower and upper bound it states"
  claim
    handler unit_conversion
    browser_handler tryUnitConversion
    admits_on measured_quantity
    because "issue 1175 R3: a conversion claims only with a stated number and exactly two named units, never on a convert word alone"
  claim
    handler calendar_reasoning
    browser_handler tryCalendarReasoning
    admits_on calendar_date_signal
    admits_on calendar_anchor
    because "issue 1175 R3: calendar arithmetic claims only with the day it starts from, a weekday, a month, a stated date or today, or with an event's date signal"
  default ask
  claim
    handler test_generation
    browser_handler tryTestGeneration
    admits_on function_under_test
    refusal_event test_generation:refusal
    because "issue 1175 R3: a test request claims a suite only with the function under test it names; without one it is admitted to the refusal lane, where only its named refusal is kept"
  claim
    handler code_refactoring
    browser_handler tryCodeRefactoring
    admits_on code_artifact
    refusal_event code_refactoring:refusal
    because "issue 1175 R3: a refactoring request claims a rewrite only with the code it rewrites; without code it is admitted to the refusal lane, where only its named refusal is kept"
  claim
    handler format_conversion
    browser_handler tryFormatConversion
    admits_on structured_document
    refusal_event format_conversion:refusal
    because "issue 1175 R3: a conversion request claims a converted document only with the document it converts; without one it is admitted to the refusal lane, where only its named refusal is kept"
